  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\nYou spin around, looking for who could possibly be speaking to you. You see a tiny bee, no bigger than a quarter, as it flies up from your shoulder to hover in front of your face. You know you should scream and run, but you are simply too shocked. \n\n\"I'm sorry, your Majesty, I didn't mean to startle you.\" spoke (buzzed?) the tiny bee. \"We've been trying to reach you for so long, I became over-excited.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 45,
  "reference_text": " I am a bee of the Royal Guard, and I am here to protect you, your Majesty.\"\n\n\nYou look around, making sure no one is watching. \"I don't understand. I thought you were the dangerous ones.\" \n\n\"We are dangerous, your Majesty, but only to those who would harm you.",
